 unfinished cut, nested settings and explicit Resume.\n\nThis is a correction within P03. Full navigation, physical-device/controller and disconnected-play acceptance remain separate. GitHub Pages deployment and its public file/browser checks are recorded separately; previous releases remain available.\n\nThe attached source qualification, original-byte verification and evidence archive contain the exact source and test records.\n"}